# Game_Zombie — Zombie Escape Time Trial (ID 11)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_Zombie.h, Game_Zombie.cpp
# HTML: data/game_zombie_setup.html, game_zombie_names.html, game_zombie_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Time trial: groups race start→target puck faster than shrinking target time.
Shuttle mode: back-and-forth. Auto-reduce target on success. Sudden death option.
1-10 groups with synchronized or independent start.

## CONFIG
- numGroups (1-10), startTargetTime (seconds), timeReduction (ms*100)
- autoReduce (on success), suddenDeath (eliminate on fail)
- groupStart (synchronized), shuttleMode

## STATES per group
Z_SETUP → Z_WAIT_HANDS → Z_COUNTDOWN (3s, SKI) → Z_RUNNING → Z_EVALUATE (3s) → back or Z_ELIMINATED
Optional: Z_FALSE_START

## KEY MECHANICS
- Target time decreases per success (autoReduce) or manually (man_reduce)
- evaluateRun(): if runTime <= targetTime → winner (success sound, RAINBOW)
- If runTime > targetTime → fail (EXPLOSION). SuddenDeath → Z_ELIMINATED
- Timeout: auto-fail if runTime > targetTime + 3000ms
- Shuttle: toggles expectStart between target and start puck
- shuttleLaps counter tracks round-trips
- globalBestTime / globalBestGroup across all groups
- 10 group colors

## COMMANDS
cfg_groups, cfg_time, cfg_reduce, cfg_auto, cfg_sudden, cfg_sync, cfg_shuttle,
start, stop, reset, man_reduce, man_elim (groupIdx), man_revive (groupIdx), exit

## STATUS JSON
{sync, auto, shuttle, bestT, bestG, groups: [{id, st, targ, rnd, hld, shl (laps), exp (expectStart), time}]}
